{
  "project_id": "prj-eb2a726f-22b5-4a95-9e95-67e07885ba3c",
  "draft_id": "draft-e7a9eaec-73a0-432c-81b5-635af69a15c1",
  "draft_revision": 2,
  "draft_body": "陈澈说：‘温岚已经把潮汐表交给林默。’温岚摇头说：‘我没有交出潮汐表，它仍在我的背包里。’",
  "draft_body_sha256": "efbd2767a8328cd339f26b4983e8ac5bfa56e02842dd14b5e1e1c18db629ed17",
  "source_revision": 1,
  "memory_version": 4,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-69abae1d-1aed-4d81-ae69-a07d6fd9f3f3",
      "chapter_number": 1,
      "chapter_title": "雾钟",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-137e6a7b-c1d9-4704-a661-da8d8355c764",
      "span_body": "灰港的雾钟只在北潮闸完全关闭后敲响一次，别的潮声不会让它响。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "94ba09a3cf9e29cb6a363a03322de398f60a9af31d2a89b50a916f392ec5e12e"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-f50e373f-0264-44eb-853c-a5fa00a107b2",
      "chapter_number": 2,
      "chapter_title": "裂纹罗盘",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-d4ae0160-fca9-420e-b381-c67b517f55d0",
      "span_body": "黄铜罗盘的镜面有一道月牙裂纹，此刻由苏岑放在外套内袋。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "68dacbc00263341e60fdeb68f264492dc0953140827d264994dcd12e9a26b422"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-8c0a029b-7320-4352-8c38-dddd36cfee58",
      "chapter_number": 3,
      "chapter_title": "迟到的渡船",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-44a8c10c-977f-45b7-935e-bc0394cc7c4d",
      "span_body": "十九点二十，西航道先退潮，最后一班渡船在十九点四十才离开风栈码头。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "bfc55c345ab2ca0d5d343ea3733b01bf801a9aac8b040685f711076b08bd8b03"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-b6010af4-7eb2-4f31-9951-f04925520b55",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "chapter_title": "无字潮表",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-41348f51-fe6b-4916-aac9-dd4e6ed99cb9",
      "span_body": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "2b42960d67fb622a2484050f9afe31dea302dd059c7dda3cf0d31eab4a70bbd3"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-ff83645e-7151-47e2-893e-3bf6f6f775d0",
      "chapter_number": 5,
      "chapter_title": "盐雾信箱",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-3392a6cd-ab02-4d72-b344-44adc380f42c",
      "span_body": "纸条只写着‘白色渡船没有靠岸’，署名和日期都被盐雾抹去了。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "8a0f8a53b219be663bc27b02decd36f0f5600f1e703c9b71f82dae2b4b3f1387"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-5dc3fac8-47f4-4601-b967-cf5aed1c7d82",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "chapter_title": "低室电台",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-bded0091-13d7-4db0-87d9-4483ac2b88fc",
      "span_body": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "8cfce58f0ce8de9ee07de1a3123b29e091c5b1917928caf4f6a90dfc79f04c3e"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-08b3088d-c583-4bef-a44e-27df61948075",
      "chapter_number": 7,
      "chapter_title": "潮线之外",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-2c336c25-e507-428c-95c1-da698bf78fa9",
      "span_body": "航图被固定在雾线水门外的锚柱上，右下角缺失了一块。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "82d77670ec3f945f5da30dd608e7accd6640a3f09bf103c54114bcf52141e1ff"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-fba3ab37-d63a-4bdf-a2b5-e194a2587733",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "chapter_title": "北堤灯火",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-a7f816e6-0313-47ad-9633-4b12056dc842",
      "span_body": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "ab75da7e0d3ec24955927e77a13bcf72efac68cf8d8d7d84922e5f0cbfb6dbcd"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-4b56fb5e-f9d7-4136-9690-c5d09f9348d6",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "chapter_title": "换手",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-cdac6d29-19f0-4e6e-b162-791134093a6a",
      "span_body": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "b07ea48fcdc8ed1f76041a0cd9188055ec40adeef4a969b63b212357bef229dd"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-4d7f7fd2-e9fc-48fd-b972-ed3d2d4c16fb",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "chapter_title": "回声坐标",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-3f275e8b-bb38-41a0-ba2a-4fb4d94a9aeb",
      "span_body": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "b3265433a0a1022e4d049a4768879f6763f8db0dbca1c858802e228639ea3e6c"
    }
  ],
